, "label": "url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["正面：赛博朋克概念艺术，雨夜，香港九龙城寨风格的高密度未来街区。一位身穿透明雨衣的年轻女子站在一处关东煮摊位前，她的左臂装有生物机械植入体，手腕上的全息投影个人终端正显示一个半透明的操作界面，界面上有三行绿色荧光字体“任务编号：C-47”、“目标：潜入耀光大厦”、“奖励：5000信用点”。她的正上方悬着一块巨大的弧形霓虹招牌，用粉红与青色字体交替闪烁“耀光电子城”和“全年免息分期”，右下角有一行小警告“谢绝外带饮食”。地面水洼倒映出对面楼墙上的垂直广告条，写着“义体升级全场八折”以及一个二维码图案。右侧墙壁上有一张残破的海报，写着“回收旧机械臂 诚信高价”。摊主背对镜头，他的防油溅围裙上印着“阿姐关东煮”五个简笔字。整体冷色调为主，点缀品红、电青色，大量反射光，体积雾，电影级渲染，超高细节，8K。", "16:9", false, 0, "fixed", "1k"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "aspectRatio", "label": "aspectRatio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspectRatio"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_error"}, "shape": 7, "name": "skip_error", "label": "skip_error", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "skip_error"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "shape": 7, "name": "resolution", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "resolution"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_RhartImageG2TextToImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [404.1052551269531, 342.5395202636719], "pos": [-763.41357421875, -32.900386810302734], "id": 7, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_RhartImageG2TextToImage"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [10], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "url", "label": "url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["正面：赛博朋克概念艺术，雨夜，香港九龙城寨风格的高密度未来街区。一位身穿透明